'''Ozanne''' is is an [[NPC]] found in the {{zone|Thaumaturgist}}. She offers a refund for [[Reforging|Reforges]] on [[Accessories]] that were Reforged with the [[Blacksmith]]. 

== Refunds ==
Ozanne will refund the player {{c}}, depending on the rarity of their Accessories and the reforges applied to the Accessories. The maximum amount of coins she will refund is {{c|5M}} before she stops refunding.
